{"id":"63308cd051c46e93","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-prop-entropy-properties.md","title":"Entropy Properties","display":"prop-entropy-properties — Entropy Properties","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-prop-entropy-properties","aliases":["58-prop-entropy-properties"],"display":"prop-entropy-properties — Entropy Properties","depends_on":["[[../batch17/58-df-entropy.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-prop-entropy-properties"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-prop-entropy-properties</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-entropy-properties — Entropy Properties"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"bc3b74121029112d\" href=\"?note=bc3b74121029112d\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-entropy.md\">../batch17/58-df-entropy.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0578a357a86e9d8f\" href=\"?note=0578a357a86e9d8f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md\">../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\">\\((X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\)</span> (probability space)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,\\beta\">\\(\\alpha,\\beta\\)</span> (finite measurable partitions of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma\\in V\">\\(\\gamma\\in V\\)</span> (the join partition, constructed in the assertion)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_\\mu\">\\(H_\\mu\\)</span> (entropy functional from dependency)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}\">\\(\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}\\)</span> (probability-space predicate from dependency)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FiniteMeasurablePartition}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{FiniteMeasurablePartition}_S\\)</span> (finite measurable-partition predicate from dependency)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}entropy-properties}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\n\\land\\mathrm{FiniteMeasurablePartition}_S(\\alpha,X,\\mathcal F)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{FiniteMeasurablePartition}_S(\\beta,X,\\mathcal F)\n\\land\\varnothing\\notin\\alpha\\cup\\beta\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\to\\exists\\gamma\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\gamma=\\{A\\cap B\\mid A\\in\\alpha\\land B\\in\\beta\n\\land A\\cap B\\ne\\varnothing\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{FiniteMeasurablePartition}_S\n(\\gamma,X,\\mathcal F)\n\\land H_\\mu(\\gamma)\\leq H_\\mu(\\alpha)+H_\\mu(\\beta)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\Bigl(\n\\bigl[\\forall A\\in\\alpha\\;\\forall B\\in\\beta\\;\n\\mu(A\\cap B)=\\mu(A)\\mu(B)\\bigr]\n\\to H_\\mu(\\gamma)=H_\\mu(\\alpha)+H_\\mu(\\beta)\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}entropy-properties}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\n\\land\\mathrm{FiniteMeasurablePartition}_S(\\alpha,X,\\mathcal F)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{FiniteMeasurablePartition}_S(\\beta,X,\\mathcal F)\n\\land\\varnothing\\notin\\alpha\\cup\\beta\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\to\\exists\\gamma\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\gamma=\\{A\\cap B\\mid A\\in\\alpha\\land B\\in\\beta\n\\land A\\cap B\\ne\\varnothing\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{FiniteMeasurablePartition}_S\n(\\gamma,X,\\mathcal F)\n\\land H_\\mu(\\gamma)\\leq H_\\mu(\\alpha)+H_\\mu(\\beta)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\Bigl(\n\\bigl[\\forall A\\in\\alpha\\;\\forall B\\in\\beta\\;\n\\mu(A\\cap B)=\\mu(A)\\mu(B)\\bigr]\n\\to H_\\mu(\\gamma)=H_\\mu(\\alpha)+H_\\mu(\\beta)\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Entropy is subadditive for joins, and equality holds when the two finite measurable partitions are independent.</li>\n<li>The join is constructed inside the formula, so <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vee\">\\(\\vee\\)</span> is not an unbound operation symbol.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch17/58-df-entropy.md","status":"resolved","id":"bc3b74121029112d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-entropy.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"0578a357a86e9d8f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha,\\beta","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\gamma\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"H_\\mu","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FiniteMeasurablePartition}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}entropy-properties}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\n\\land\\mathrm{FiniteMeasurablePartition}_S(\\alpha,X,\\mathcal F)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\mathrm{FiniteMeasurablePartition}_S(\\beta,X,\\mathcal F)\n\\land\\varnothing\\notin\\alpha\\cup\\beta\\\\\n&\\quad\\to\\exists\\gamma\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\gamma=\\{A\\cap B\\mid A\\in\\alpha\\land B\\in\\beta\n\\land A\\cap B\\ne\\varnothing\\}\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{FiniteMeasurablePartition}_S\n(\\gamma,X,\\mathcal F)\n\\land H_\\mu(\\gamma)\\leq H_\\mu(\\alpha)+H_\\mu(\\beta)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\Bigl(\n\\bigl[\\forall A\\in\\alpha\\;\\forall B\\in\\beta\\;\n\\mu(A\\cap B)=\\mu(A)\\mu(B)\\bigr]\n\\to H_\\mu(\\gamma)=H_\\mu(\\alpha)+H_\\mu(\\beta)\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\vee","display":false}],"bytes":1713,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3955","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-prop-entropy-properties.md|58-prop-entropy-properties]]（batch01）"}],"outgoing":["bc3b74121029112d","0578a357a86e9d8f"]}